; ==========================================================================
; STELLAR RACE CONDITION  -  VM2: the second worker   (loads at $5000)   (web copy based at $4000: the Multitasking page moves program 2 to $5000 itself)
; ==========================================================================
; Load BOTH programs - Race-VM1.lst at $4000 and Race-VM2.lst at $5000 - then
; cold-boot. VM1 and VM2 each add 1 to a shared counter 500 times (READ it, ADD
; one, WRITE it back). Round 1 has no lock and loses updates when the scheduler
; switches VMs between a read and its write; round 2 wraps the three opcodes in
; $C7 SETMULTI 00 / 01 and gets exactly 1000. VM1 prints the scores.
;
; The counter is in VM1's memory (relative $0F00); VM1 opens it with $D0 SHAREVM
; read/write, and VM2 uses the cross-VM copies $D4 COPYVMXY / $D5 COPYXVMY. The
; ADDRESS in those copies is VM1's register (R7 counter, R8 GO, R9 DONE - VM1 sets
; them once and never reuses them); only the value register is VM2's own.
; GO ($0F02) and DONE ($0F04) words coordinate the rounds; Race-VM1.lst clears
; them in its D-lines so leftovers from an earlier run cannot start a round early.
;
; VERIFICATION (Firmware-Math/race_verify.py, V0061.33, two-VM cold boot): round 1 loses 200 of 1000 (got 800), round 2 gets exactly 1000; the loss is deterministic (opcode-count scheduler), so the Elf2K should show the same 200.
; NOT YET RUN ON HARDWARE.
;
; 44 STELLAR commands.
;
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; DISASSEMBLY  -  commented out; the loader skips it
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

; D 5000 CD             START
; D 5001 11 0F 00 0A    LOADXI R15 000A
; W1:
; D 5005 D4 10 84       COPYVMXY VM1 M(VM1 R8) -> R4       VM1's GO word
; D 5008 86 04 00 01    TESTXI R4 0001
; D 500C A1 00 05       IFFALSEI W1                        Wait for round 1
; D 500F 11 05 01 F4    LOADXI R5 01F4
; D 5013 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; D 5017 11 0A 0F 00    LOADXI R10 0F00
; L1:
; D 501B D4 10 7B       COPYVMXY VM1 M(VM1 R7) -> RB       READ the counter (from VM1)
; D 501E 42 0B          INCX R11                           ADD one
; D 5020 D5 10 B7       COPYXVMY RB -> VM1 M(VM1 R7)       WRITE it back (to VM1)
; D 5023 43 06          DECX R6
; D 5025 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 5027 A1 00 30       IFFALSEI N1
; D 502A CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'                     A mark every 50 adds
; D 502C 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; N1:
; D 5030 43 05          DECX R5
; D 5032 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 5034 A1 00 1B       IFFALSEI L1
; D 5037 11 04 00 01    LOADXI R4 0001
; D 503B D5 10 49       COPYXVMY R4 -> VM1 M(VM1 R9)       DONE round 1
; W2:
; D 503E D4 10 84       COPYVMXY VM1 M(VM1 R8) -> R4
; D 5041 86 04 00 02    TESTXI R4 0002
; D 5045 A1 00 3E       IFFALSEI W2                        Wait for round 2
; D 5048 11 05 01 F4    LOADXI R5 01F4
; D 504C 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; D 5050 11 0A 0F 00    LOADXI R10 0F00
; L2:
; D 5054 C7 00          SETMULTI 00                        Lock: no switching from here ...
; D 5056 D4 10 7B       COPYVMXY VM1 M(VM1 R7) -> RB       READ the counter (from VM1)
; D 5059 42 0B          INCX R11                           ADD one
; D 505B D5 10 B7       COPYXVMY RB -> VM1 M(VM1 R7)       WRITE it back (to VM1)
; D 505E C7 01          SETMULTI 01                        ... to here
; D 5060 43 06          DECX R6
; D 5062 8C 06          TESTXZ R6
; D 5064 A1 00 6D       IFFALSEI N2
; D 5067 CA 32          SEROUTI 32 '2'                     A mark every 50 adds
; D 5069 11 06 00 32    LOADXI R6 0032
; N2:
; D 506D 43 05          DECX R5
; D 506F 8C 05          TESTXZ R5
; D 5071 A1 00 54       IFFALSEI L2
; D 5074 11 04 00 02    LOADXI R4 0002
; D 5078 D5 10 49       COPYXVMY R4 -> VM1 M(VM1 R9)       DONE round 2
; D 507B 00             HALT                               VM2 finished
; D 507C F0 00 00       BREAK                              End marker

; --------------------------------------------------------------------------
; CODE  -  download this block
; --------------------------------------------------------------------------

D 4000 CD
D 4001 11 0F 00 0A
D 4005 D4 10 84
D 4008 86 04 00 01
D 400C A1 00 05
D 400F 11 05 01 F4
D 4013 11 06 00 32
D 4017 11 0A 0F 00
D 401B D4 10 7B
D 401E 42 0B
D 4020 D5 10 B7
D 4023 43 06
D 4025 8C 06
D 4027 A1 00 30
D 402A CA 32
D 402C 11 06 00 32
D 4030 43 05
D 4032 8C 05
D 4034 A1 00 1B
D 4037 11 04 00 01
D 403B D5 10 49
D 403E D4 10 84
D 4041 86 04 00 02
D 4045 A1 00 3E
D 4048 11 05 01 F4
D 404C 11 06 00 32
D 4050 11 0A 0F 00
D 4054 C7 00
D 4056 D4 10 7B
D 4059 42 0B
D 405B D5 10 B7
D 405E C7 01
D 4060 43 06
D 4062 8C 06
D 4064 A1 00 6D
D 4067 CA 32
D 4069 11 06 00 32
D 406D 43 05
D 406F 8C 05
D 4071 A1 00 54
D 4074 11 04 00 02
D 4078 D5 10 49
D 407B 00
D 407C F0 00 00
